  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "三条公式",
      "items": [
        "block_bytes = 2 · L · 256 · H_kv · d · itemsize(:112)",
        "桌数 = ⌊(total · util − used − peak + current) / block_bytes⌋(:113)",
        "试做:seq_len = min(预算, max_model_len),num_seqs = min(预算 ÷ seq_len, max_num_seqs)(:94-97)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "顺序为什么不能换",
      "items": [
        "领班在厨房之后建(llm_engine.py:31-34):桌数是试做之后才算出来写回店规的",
        "分店先 spawn,各自完整跑一遍厨房初始化;窗口由 rank 0 建,barrier 后分店才 attach"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "写死的东西",
      "items": [
        "NCCL tcp://localhost:2333;共享内存名 nanovllm、1 MiB",
        "graph_bs = 1, 2, 4, 8, 16 … 512,倒序捕获、共享一个池;TP 1 到 8;桌大小是 256 的倍数"
